/v1/","context":{"app_id":4731600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1846018067931186","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"This update makes building words a little smoother and enemy effects easier to follow.• Reworked some enemy attacks to make gameplay less confusing. • Letter stones no longer push each other away. It was getting in the way of building words. • The element of every word you play now influences the element distribution of future stone draws. • Phrase Stones can now be combined with any valid word, instead of only specific special words.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T19:16:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931186","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1844751498228145","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Tutorial, Shields and Leaderboards","summary":"The new demo update is live! It adds a guided tutorial, shields and Steam leaderboards. You now decide when to open the shop, and the end of each run gives you a much better look at how you played. A tutorial you can playInstead of reading through pop-ups, you now learn by doing. Draw stones, build your first word, choose an enemy and cast an attack. The tutorial also explains locking stones and using the shop.It runs in turn-based mode so you can take your time. Once you finish, the game switch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T22:03:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1842846814451559","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes","summary":"New & ChangedAdded 3 more bosses that can randomly appear in the demoIntegrated additional enemy mechanics needed for the full versionReworked some enemy effectsSlightly adjusted the shop layoutChanged how hearts are collectedAdded small animations when collecting hearts and shardsStones containing all elements now have rainbow colorsHovering over a character now shows their current itemsMade some small UI adjustmentsAdded missing sound effectsFixesFixed the death screen being triggered more tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T19:35:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451559","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1840944183789787","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop, Items & Overload","summary":"Shop & ItemsThe new shop lets you buy letter stones and items or reroll the available offers. Items change the rules of your run and can be freely combined.Melt Letter StonesLetter stones you no longer need can be dragged onto the melting icon at any time. The number of shards you receive depends on the quality of the stone.OverloadIf you exceed your hand limit, you will take overload damage after attacking. The further you exceed the limit, the more damage you take.Have fun trying out the new f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T19:49:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1840310314343131","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes","summary":"Improved Letter Stone PlacementLetter stones no longer push each other away when placed. A new snap system automatically arranges them neatly. There is also a new sort button, and stones can now be removed from the word field with a single click. This makes forming and adjusting words much easier and faster. Additional ChangesLetter stones can now only be upgraded to a maximum quality level of 5.A stone’s strength and elements are now displayed when hovering over it.New mythological spell words ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T20:49:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314343131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1839676055895236","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes","summary":"Expanded DictionariesFull German and English dictionaries have been added, each containing more than 100,000 words.Words are now recognized much more reliably, including rarer and shorter words.Improved Element SystemA word’s primary element is now determined by the elemental letter stones it contains.The element represented by the most stones becomes the word’s primary element.Certain special words grant additional bonuses to matching elements.Letter Stone LockingLetter stones can now be locked","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T16:23:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895236","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1835236783567491","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes - Spellphrase Stones","summary":"Added• Added Spellphrase Stones to help players discover Spellphrases more naturally. • Added Ball, Wave and Nova Spellphrase visuals.Changes• Increased Spellphrase Stone drop chance in the demo. • Improved onboarding for hidden spell systems.NotesAfter watching several players try the demo, it became clear that many never discovered the Spellphrase system at all. This small update is intended to make Ball, Wave and Nova easier to find without removing the joy of experimentation.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T10:58:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1834602721195729","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Discovery Mode","summary":"This update introduces Discovery Mode, a new way to play LETTERBANE designed especially for new players.The goal of this mode is to make the game more accessible and help new players gradually learn the word and spell systems.• Discover hidden words and spells as you play• Gradually reveal clues for undiscovered words• New Discovery and Challenge mode selection at the start of a run• Improved guidance for learning the game's spell systemWhether you're new to word games or a veteran word wizard, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T11:36:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721195729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731600-1834602721194225","game_id":"steam-4731600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Expanded Word Database","summary":"Thanks to everyone who tried the demo!This update expands the English and German word databases with many new words, including additional fantasy, mythology and everyday vocabulary.I've also improved word validation and fixed various spelling issues and inconsistencies. Thanks for playing Letterbane!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T17:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4731600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4731600":"2026-10-26T04:00:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4731600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4806430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:00:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4731600","app_id":4731600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:54Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5028c3f444e9dd0b28d53c945e13905cfcc66af8e6e90b8a96fa24dd353f0cdd","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A dark fantasy roguelite where words are your weapons. Draw magical letter stones, build words to attack, collect powerful items and combine elemental synergies as you fight your way through increasingly dangerous enemies.","publishers":[{"name":"indiegates"}],"developers":[{"name":"indiegates"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Letterbane","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}